---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: Field notes on personal projects, algorithms, and things Daniel Chigbu has been building.
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="sheet-label fade-in">SHEET 03 · FIELD NOTES</p>
    <h1 class="fade-in">Blog</h1>
    <p class="page-desc fade-in">Notes on personal projects and research, written up after the build,
      not instead of it.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="panel-grid two-col stagger-children">
      {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
        <div class="fade-in" style="--i:{{ loop.index0 }}">
          {% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
